{
  "info": {
    "name": "E-Verify Checker",
    "description": "Federal E-Verify Employer Search and STEM OPT Checker.\n\nGive this collection to the frontend developer for `/tools/everify`.\n\nProduction base URL is the collection variable `baseUrl` (http://74.208.184.175:517). For local, change it to http://127.0.0.1:9001.\n\nNo auth. No request body. GET only.\n\nSearch button: GET /api/everify/search\nDropdowns: GET /api/everify/filters\n\nSend dropdown `value`, not the visible label.\n\nstate: All | California | Washington | New York | Texas | Massachusetts\nindustry: All | software | fintech | healthtech | defense\n\nIndustry is accepted and returned. It does not remove rows (`industry_applied` is false).\nState filters hiring-site locations (CA, WA, NY, TX, MA).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://74.208.184.175:517"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Dropdowns",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET filters",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/everify/filters",
            "description": "Fills State Location and Industry Category.\n\nUse data.states[].value and data.industries[].value in the search request.\nShow data.states[].label and data.industries[].label in the dropdown."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('states and industries', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(data.ok).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(data.states.map(function (row) { return row.value; })).to.eql(['All', 'California', 'Washington', 'New York', 'Texas', 'Massachusetts']);",
                  "    pm.expect(data.industries.map(function (row) { return row.value; })).to.eql(['All', 'software', 'fintech', 'healthtech', 'defense']);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Search E-Verify Database",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Search Google in California",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/everify/search?company=Google&state=California&industry=software&limit=25&offset=0",
            "description": "This is the Search E-Verify Database button.\n\nUI mapping:\n- Employer Legal Name or Company Keyword -> company\n- State Location California (SF Bay Area & LA) -> California\n- Industry Category Software, Cloud & AI Tech -> software\n\nShow data.message under the button.\nEach result: employer, dba, account_status, enrolled, e_verify_plus, date_enrolled, hiring_sites, hiring_site_states, mou_registered, stem_opt_24_month.\n\nstem_opt_24_month: eligible | not_eligible | unknown\nunknown is not a confirmed No."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('search shape', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(data.ok).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(data.company).to.eql('Google');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.state).to.eql('California');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.industry).to.eql('software');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.industry_applied).to.eql(false);",
                  "    pm.expect(data).to.have.property('message');",
                  "    pm.expect(data).to.have.property('results');",
                  "    pm.expect(data).to.have.property('stem_opt_24_month');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Search all states and industries",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/everify/search?company=Microsoft&state=All&industry=All&limit=25&offset=0",
            "description": "Same Search button with both dropdowns on their first option."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Search Washington",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/everify/search?company=Microsoft&state=Washington&industry=All&limit=25&offset=0",
            "description": "State Location: Washington (Seattle / Redmond)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Search New York",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/everify/search?company=Google&state=New York&industry=All&limit=25&offset=0",
            "description": "State Location: New York (NYC Metro)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Search Texas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/everify/search?company=Google&state=Texas&industry=All&limit=25&offset=0",
            "description": "State Location: Texas (Austin / Dallas)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Search Massachusetts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/everify/search?company=Google&state=Massachusetts&industry=All&limit=25&offset=0",
            "description": "State Location: Massachusetts (Boston / Cambridge)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Errors",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Unknown state returns 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/everify/search?company=Google&state=Florida&industry=All",
            "description": "Show response.detail. Florida is not one of the State Location options."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 400', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Company too short returns 422",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/everify/search?company=G&state=All&industry=All",
            "description": "Employer keyword must be at least 2 characters. Show response.detail."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 422', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(422);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Single company check",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET lookup Microsoft",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/everify/lookup?company=Microsoft",
            "description": "Optional. The Checker screen should call /api/everify/search, not this.\n\ne_verified is yes or unknown. unknown is not a confirmed No."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
